; font-weight: 400;\"></div><p style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></p><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">מה ז<span style=\"background-color: white;\">ה&nbsp;פָשָׂה?</span></span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">ביצע פשע</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">התרחב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">התכווץ</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">קיסר</span></li></ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">מה זה&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: white;\">שְׁחִין?</span></span></li><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-weight: 400;\">פצע חם</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-weight: 400;\">שכחן</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-weight: 400;\">ערב של 'חינה'</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-weight: 400;\">נשיכת צרעה</span></span></li></ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">מה שמו של נגע צרעת בראש או בזקן?</span></li><ol><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">תֹר</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שְּׁתִי</span></span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: white; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בֹּהַק</span></span></li><li><span style=\