/span></span></span></span></span></span><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><h3 style=\"font-size: large; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ביטוי מקראי</span></h3><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">1: \"</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">אִשָּׁה כִּי</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"> תַזְרִיעַ וְיָלְדָה זָכָר\"</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">2:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"בְּכָל קֹדֶשׁ </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">לֹא תִגָּע</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">3: \"</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וְאֶל הַמִּקְדָּשׁ </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">לֹא תָבֹא</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"וּבִמְלֹאת יְמֵי טָהֳרָהּ לְבֵן </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">אוֹ לְבַת</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"שְׁתֵּי תֹרִים </span><span style=\"background-color: #ffa400;\">אוֹ שְׁנֵי</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"> בְּנֵי יוֹנָה\"</span></span></span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מבחן אמריקאי</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">1- התרחב<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">2- פצע חם<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">3- נתק<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">4- כחול</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">רק, רקק, קרקר, ירקרק, רקיק, קיק, ק\"ק</span></p></span></div></div></div>"
